        "body": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p>Email <strong>orders@caratforus.com</strong> with the quote itself, who issued it and when, and the full specification it covers — metal, stone type, carat weight, quality and any certification. The more completely a quote is documented, the faster we can verify it.</p><p>We may decline a submission we cannot authenticate, or one that is not comparable to what we would make. We will tell you which, and why.</p>"
